<title>USA: Bowling Green, Mo. yields 6.00 pct in 2017.</title>
<headline>Bowling Green, Mo. yields 6.00 pct in 2017.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stifel Nicolaus &amp; Co Inc said it</p>
<p>priced $4.080 million of Bowling Green, Mo., combined waterworks</p>
<p>and sewerage sytem revenue bonds with a top yield of 6.00 percent</p>
<p>in 2017.</p>
